,"repetitionSource":null,"cacheConfig":{"timeToLive":0,"scopeAttributeId":null,"strategy":"NO_CACHING"},"secret":false,"permissions":{"inherit":true,"rolePermissions":[]},"resolvers":[{"attributeResolverType":"request","condition":{"empty":{}},"valueProcessor":null,"name":null}],"querySettings":null,"valueProcessor":null,"properties":[]},{"objectType":"AttributeDefinition","id":"fa7fc4c1-722a-45b7-886c-ac396228b35d","version":"c484e5b9-921b-4af2-ac05-0c96a0d28b78","type":"ATTRIBUTE","name":"token_aud","fullName":"token_aud","description":"","parentId":null,"numberOfChildren":null,"valueType":"STRING","defaultValue":"","repetitionSource":null,"cacheConfig":{"timeToLive":0,"scopeAttributeId":null,"strategy":"NO_CACHING"},"secret":false,"permissions":{"inherit":true,"rolePermissions":[]},"resolvers":[{"attributeResolverType":"request","condition":{"empty":{}},"valueProcessor":null,"name":null}],"querySettings":null,"valueProcessor":null,"properties":[]},{"objectType":"AttributeDefinition","id":"fe331926-24ba-4822-86f3-f3daace2b8ca","version":"6623df0a-df04-488b-b667-b8031eece5d9","type":"ATTRIBUTE","name":"user_acr","fullName":"user_acr","description":"","parentId":null,"numberOfChildren":null,"valueType":"STRING","defaultValue":"","repetitionSource":null,"cacheConfig":{"timeToLive":0,"scopeAttributeId":null,"strategy":"NO_CACHING"},"secret":false,"permissions":{"inherit":true,"rolePermissions":[]},"resolvers":[{"attributeResolverType":"request","condition":{"empty":{}},"valueProcessor":null,"name":null}],"querySettings":null,"valueProcessor":null,"properties":[]},{"objectType":"AttributeDefinition","id":"81b4ac87-1bdf-4942-a908-3434c6e8a26a","version":"b6aedb1b-512c-4983-b546-170feca2f593","type":"ATTRIBUTE","name":"user_scope","fullName":"user_scope","description":"","parentId":null,"numberOfChildren":null,"valueType":"STRING","defaultValue":"","repetitionSource":null,"cacheConfig":{"timeToLive":0,"scopeAttributeId":null,"strategy":"NO_CACHING"},"secret":false,"permissions":{"inherit":true,"rolePermissions":[]},"resolvers":[{"attributeResolverType":"request","condition":{"empty":{}},"valueProcessor":null,"name":null}],"querySettings":null,"valueProcessor":null,"properties":[]},{"objectType":"ServiceDefinition","id":"3c7262b0-27ee-4f0a-b00b-b0de70ab470d","version":"6f6fde63-52fb-409c-a840-6690236c296f","type":"SERVICE","name":"ConsentDirectory","fullName":"ConsentDirectory","description":"PIP over the ID Partners consent directory (GET /consents/check): matches subject + amount <= consented + creditor + currency. ASSURANCE WARNING: what this reports is APP-ASSERTED consent — the BFF recorded it after a passkey ceremony that signed a RANDOM challenge, not a signature over this payment. The consent row can be produced without the signature, so it is NOT non-repudiable and would NOT satisfy PSD2 RTS Art.5 dynamic linking. Demo-grade evidence only. See demo/TRANSACTION-AUTHORIZATION.md section 2.","parentId":null,"numberOfChildren":null,"valueType":"JSON","serviceType":"RESTFUL","secret":false,"permissions":{"inherit":true,"rolePermissions":[]},"serviceSettings":{"serviceSettingsType":"RestSettings","description":"SERVICE: RESTFUL; Verb = GET; Content Type: null","restAuthenticationType":"NONE","urlFormat":"https://proofing-directory-staging.up.railway.app/consents/check?subject={{4983c989-07d6-4664-8845-a47462495b17}}&creditor={{3b666084-491b-48d3-a105-5c050eede7cd}}&amount={{e93e97e7-da6e-46fb-aed6-4687fd9cc7d2}}&currency={{3abb6938-fbaf-46af-8bdc-41f49bc966bc}}","verb":"GET","headers":[],"responseHandling":{"returnFullResponse":false},"authenticationAttributes":{}},"cacheSettings":null,"serviceResilience":{"maximumConcurrentRequests":2,"maximumRequestsPerSecond":1000000.0,"timeoutMilliseconds":2000,"maximumRetryCount":2,"holdoffMilliseconds":1000,"retryStrategy":"BACKOFF","retryJitter":10.0,"circuitBreaker":null},"valueProcessor":null,"properties":[]},{"objectType":"AttributeDefinition","id":"b31b73ce-0b8e-484b-b45e-3af239f06990","version":"f0ecd07a-d453-4f5e-86b9-f44ce7e0f7b9","type":"ATTRIBUTE","name":"consent_assurance","fullName":"consent_assurance","description":"The assurance level ACTUALLY ACHIEVED for the consent covering this payment, from the ConsentDirectory PIP ($.assurance). device-signed = a paired device signed over the transaction hash (dynamically linked, artefact retained, PSD2 RTS Art.5-shaped). device-approved = a paired device approved but sent no signature (presence, not agreement). app-asserted = browser passkey signed a RANDOM challenge; the app asserts the rest — NOT non-repudiable. Resolved only for make_payment. Defaults to app-asserted so an unknown level is treated as the WEAKEST, never the strongest.","parentId":null,"numberOfChildren":null,"valueType":"STRING","defaultValue":"app-asserted","repetitionSource":null,"cacheConfig":{"timeToLive":0,"scopeAttributeId":null,"strategy":"NO_CACHING"},"secret":false,"permissions":{"inherit":true,"rolePermissions":[]},"resolvers":[{"attributeResolverType":"service","id":"3c7262b0-27ee-4f0a-b00b-b0de70ab470d","condition":{"comparison":{"left":{"attribute":{"id":"d3601f49-8768-408e-9104-8b4fb3afcfff"}},"op":"Equals","right":{"constant":{"value":"make_payment"}}}},"valueProcessor":{"type":"json-path","expression":"$.assurance","valueType":"STRING","name":""},"name":null}],"querySettings":null,"valueProcessor":null,"properties":[]},{"objectType":"AttributeDefinition","id":"6e9214c7-7b5f-429f-b772-78fb74eaedc8","version":"f03a3508-dc9f-4bf4-91f0-31828f1ad596","type":"ATTRIBUTE","name":"consent_covered","fullName":"consent_covered","description":"TRUE when the consent directory holds an AUTHORIZED consent for this principal covering this payment (amount <= consented cap, matching creditor and currency). Resolved from the ConsentDirectory PIP's 'covered' field; only resolved for make_payment. ASSURANCE: app-asserted, NOT non-repudiable — the recorded consent is not a signature over this payment (demo/TRANSACTION-AUTHORIZATION.md section 2). Defaults to false so a directory outage or timeout fails CLOSED to step-up.","parentId":null,"numberOfChildren":null,"valueType":"STRING","defaultValue":"false","repetitionSource":null,"cacheConfig":{"timeToLive":0,"scopeAttributeId":null,"strategy":"NO_CACHING"},"secret":false,"permissions":{"inherit":true,"rolePermissions":[]},"resolvers":[{"attributeResolverType":"service","id":"3c7262b0-27ee-4f0a-b00b-b0de70ab470d","condition":{"comparison":{"left":{"attribute":{"id":"d3601f49-8768-408e-9104-8b4fb3afcfff"}},"op":"Equals","right":{"constant":{"value":"make_payment"}}}},"valueProcessor":{"type":"json-path","expression":"$.covered","valueType":"STRING","name":""},"name":null}],"querySettings":null,"valueProcessor":null,"properties":[]},{"type":"SnapshotPackageFile$PackageSeparator"},{"id":"aba21bfa-9ee8-472e-8119-f35a39b3c0e4","version":"c9f8db48-bcc0-43a5-b141-5bd23599495a","type":"Statement","name":"Identity proofing required","description":"","shared":false,"code":"identity-proofing-required","appliesTo":"DENY","appliesIf":"FINAL_DECISION_MATCHES","payload":"{\"proofing\": true, \"doctype\": \"org.iso.18013.5.1.mDL\", \"message\": \"Present your mobile Driver's Licence (mDL) to open an account.\"}","obligatory":true,"permissions":{"inherit":true,"rolePermissions":[]},"services":[],"attributes":[]},{"id":"dc6596d0-e89e-493a-be55-9abb40e52faf","version":"2dcc3b01-ed86-4dbc-bdf6-22479f1e8d8c","type":"Statement","name":"Step-up required","description":"","shared":false,"code":"step-up-required","appliesTo":"DENY","appliesIf":"FINAL_DECISION_MATCHES","payload":"{\"step_up\": true, \"scope\": \"banking:payments:transfer\", \"message\": \"This payment needs your approval. Please sign in to approve it.\"}","obligatory":true,"permissions":{"inherit":true,"rolePermissions":[]},"services":[],"attributes":[]},{"id":"67144082-c770-4f7c-b50a-e4bb2b003464","version":"f45e5e78-4fe0-4944-8929-60f683e218be","type":"Statement","name":"Wrong audience","description":"","shared":false,"code":"denied-reason","appliesTo":"DENY","appliesIf":"FINAL_DECISION_MATCHES","payload":"{\"status\": 403, \"message\": \"invalid_audience\", \"detail\": \"This access token was minted for a different audience and cannot be used at the bank API (RFC 8707).\"}","obligatory":true,"permissions":{"inherit":true,"rolePermissions":[]},"services":[],"attributes":[]},{"id":"e051c46c-fd77-407d-b9fc-25df9e515388","version":"a67698c9-9eee-48db-9bfb-a7ef4f076fc0","type":"Rule","name":"Permit banking actions","description":"","shared":false,"disabled":false,"permissions":{"inherit":true,"rolePermissions":[]},"targets":[],"statements":[],"effectSettings":{"type":"unconditionalPermit"},"condition":{"or":{"conditions":[{"comparison":{"left":{"attribute":{"id":"d3601f49-8768-408e-9104-8b4fb3afcfff"}},"op":"Equals","right":{"constant":{"value":"list_accounts"}}}},{"comparison":{"left":{"attribute":{"id":"d3601f49-8768-408e-9104-8b4fb3afcfff"}},"op":"Equals","right":{"constant":{"value":"get_balance"}}}},{"comparison":{"left":{"attribute":{"id":"d3601f49-8768-408e-9104-8b4fb3afcfff"}},"op":"Equals","right":{"constant":{"value":"open_account"}}}},{"comparison":{"left":{"attribute":{"id":"d3601f49-8768-408e-9104-8b4fb3afcfff"}},"op":"Equals","right":{"constant":{"value":"make_payment"}}}},{"comparison":{"left":{"attribute":{"id":"d3601f49-8768-408e-9104-8b4fb3afcfff"}},"op":"Equals","right":{"constant":{"value":"access_mcp"}}}}]}},"properties":[]},{"id":"4a0716a7-c2d4-4e58-af96-3db49c8848c0","version":"eff0fd2d-f11b-441c-b4e1-2d4c6850b0ff","type":"Rule","name":"Deny over-limit agent payment","description":"","shared":false,"disabled":false,"permissions":{"inherit":true,"rolePermissions":[]},"targets":[],"statements":[],"effectSettings":{"type":"unconditionalDeny"},"condition":{"and":{"conditions":[{"comparison":{"left":{"attribute":{"id":"d3601f49-8768-408e-9104-8b4fb3afcfff"}},"op":"Equals","right":{"constant":{"value":"make_payment"}}}},{"comparison":{"left":{"attribute":{"id":"e93e97e7-da6e-46fb-aed6-4687fd9cc7d2"}},"op":"GreaterThan","right":{"constant":{"value":"2000"}}}}]}},"properties":[]},{"id":"751fbf1a-5f17-45c8-a700-a738b96eee92","version":"db8ef887-199d-4b48-a536-5f39d27ac9c7","type":"Rule","name":"Require identity proofing for origination","description":"mDL identity-proofing gate: deny open_account unless a verified identity-proofing activity exists (identity_proofing_present==true). Adapter reports true when the gate switch is off, so this is a no-op until the switch is flipped on.","shared":false,"disabled":false,"permissions":{"inherit":true,"rolePermissions":[]},"targets":[],"statements":["aba21bfa-9ee8-472e-8119-f35a39b3c0e4"],"effectSettings":{"type":"unconditionalDeny"},"condition":{"and":{"conditions":[{"comparison":{"left":{"attribute":{"id":"d3601f49-8768-408e-9104-8b4fb3afcfff"}},"op":"Equals","right":{"constant":{"value":"open_account"}}}},{"comparison":{"left":{"attribute":{"id":"d12763b5-ee9f-459d-8b2f-909f179e9f46"}},"op":"NotEquals","right":{"constant":{"value":"true"}}}}]}},"properties":[]},{"id":"170b2fad-30c9-4cd5-ada2-1d29d98e662b","version":"8ab0b17a-ec5f-470f-8504-24ea1dcf6638","type":"Rule","name":"Deny over-limit payment authorization","description":"","shared":false,"disabled":false,"permissions":{"inherit":true,"rolePermissions":[]},"targets":[],"statements":[],"effectSettings":{"type":"unconditionalDeny"},"condition":{"and":{"conditions":[{"comparison":{"left":{"attribute":{"id":"607db049-4679-4ad4-a009-c66db7537ce9"}},"op":"Equals","right":{"constant":{"value":"payment_initiation"}}}},{"comparison":{"left":{"attribute":{"id":"e93e97e7-da6e-46fb-aed6-4687fd9cc7d2"}},"op":"GreaterThan","right":{"constant":{"value":"2000"}}}}]}},"properties":[]},{"id":"e69d2cd0-8255-42b9-8e10-4d8b1a506d8b","version":"c388f851-c1f1-4812-9ae5-264f92b43087","type":"Rule","name":"Permit payment authorization","description":"","shared":false,"disabled":false,"permissions":{"inherit":true,"rolePermissions":[]},"targets":[],"statements":[],"effectSettings":{"type":"unconditionalPermit"},"condition":{"comparison":{"left":{"attribute":{"id":"607db049-4679-4ad4-a009-c66db7537ce9"}},"op":"Equals","right":{"constant":{"value":"payment_initiation"}}}},"properties":[]},{"id":"2ef9f47d-d4ba-4d6d-8964-d4a600f7fcc9","version":"deacd3ec-1b01-4e56-8bad-3848c8abeb5b","type":"Rule","name":"Deny wrong-audience token","description":"","shared":false,"disabled":false,"permissions":{"inherit":true,"rolePermissions":[]},"targets":[],"statements":["67144082-c770-4f7c-b50a-e4bb2b003464"],"effectSettings":{"type":"unconditionalDeny"},"condition":{"and":{"conditions":[{"comparison":{"left":{"attribute":{"id":"fa7fc4c1-722a-45b7-886c-ac396228b35d"}},"op":"NotEquals","right":{"constant":{"value":""}}}},{"comparison":{"left":{"attribute":{"id":"fa7fc4c1-722a-45b7-886c-ac396228b35d"}},"op":"NotEquals","right":{"constant":{"value":"https://api.northwind.example/bank"}}}}]}},"properties":[]},{"id":"f615cc34-d544-4e9c-8f8d-4e6c1a1f93a2","version":"3b92f3d8-5cdf-4928-813f-519b11767cf0","type":"Rule","name":"Require a DEVICE-SIGNED consent for large payments (DISABLED)","description":"ARMED SWITCH, currently DISABLED. Denies a payment > AUD 500 that is carried ONLY by an app-asserted consent — i.e. the browser-passkey path, where the signature covers a random challenge and not this payment. Enable this once the approver app signs the transaction hash (assurance device-signed); until then it would deny every interactive payment, because the consents on record are app-asserted. Deliberately left disabled rather than omitted, so the honest bar is visible in the policy and arming it is a one-flag change. See demo/TRANSACTION-AUTHORIZATION.md sections 2 and 6. NOTE: no obligation is attached — the step-up statement is private to the sibling rule. When arming this, also attach a step-up statement so the caller gets a challenge rather than a bare denial.","shared":false,"disabled":true,"permissions":{"inherit":true,"rolePermissions":[]},"targets":[],"statements":[],"effectSettings":{"type":"unconditionalDeny"},"condition":{"and":{"conditions":[{"comparison":{"left":{"attribute":{"id":"d3601f49-8768-408e-9104-8b4fb3afcfff"}},"op":"Equals","right":{"constant":{"value":"make_payment"}}}},{"comparison":{"left":{"attribute":{"id":"e93e97e7-da6e-46fb-aed6-4687fd9cc7d2"}},"op":"GreaterThan","right":{"constant":{"value":"500"}}}},{"not":{"condition":{"and":{"conditions":[{"comparison":{"left":{"attribute":{"id":"8b1b9b7f-2f75-4cc5-812c-4232dbab85c5"}},"op":"Equals","right":{"constant":{"value":"true"}}}},{"comparison":{"left":{"attribute":{"id":"69698fbc-1c29-48ff-a16e-df9f07c7eaed"}},"op":"Equals","right":{"constant":{"value":"true"}}}}]}}}},{"not":{"condition":{"and":{"conditions":[{"comparison":{"left":{"attribute":{"id":"fe331926-24ba-4822-86f3-f3daace2b8ca"}},"op":"Equals","right":{"constant":{"value":"urn:northwind:loa:staff-approval"}}}},{"comparison":{"left":{"attribute":{"id":"81b4ac87-1bdf-4942-a908-3434c6e8a26a"}},"op":"Contains","right":{"constant":{"value":"banking:payments:transfer"}}}}]}}}},{"comparison":{"left":{"attribute":{"id":"6e9214c7-7b5f-429f-b772-78fb74eaedc8"}},"op":"Equals","right":{"constant":{"value":"true"}}}},{"comparison":{"left":{"attribute":{"id":"b31b73ce-0b8e-484b-b45e-3af239f06990"}},"op":"NotEquals","right":{"constant":{"value":"device-signed"}}}}]}},"properties":[]},{"id":"4057cc49-459b-4a1b-aeac-5846e5b3f1ec","version":"97670c46-8787-43a4-93a7-fd41113bbddd","type":"Rule","name":"Require step-up for large payment","description":"make_payment strictly > AUD 500 (and <= 2000) requires approval evidence: PERMIT if ANY of (a) the interactive channel's matching RFC 9396 RAR consent (rar_amount_ok AND rar_creditor_ok); (b) the autonomous STAFF channel (acr urn:northwind:loa:staff-approval AND banking:payments:transfer scope); or (c) consent_covered — the ConsentDirectory PIP found a RECORDED authorized consent for this principal covering this amount/creditor/currency. Otherwise DENY + step-up advice. *** ASSURANCE LABEL — disjunct (c) is DEMO-GRADE ONLY. *** It accepts APP-ASSERTED consent: the BFF wrote the consent row after a passkey ceremony that signed a RANDOM challenge, so the signature does not cover this payment and the row can be produced without it. (c) is NOT non-repudiable and would NOT satisfy PSD2 RTS Art.5 dynamic linking — unlike (a), where the instruction at least rides as RAR in the token. (c) exists to unblock the demo loop; target state is CIBA + RAR. See demo/TRANSACTION-AUTHORIZATION.md sections 2, 5, 6.","shared":false,"disabled":false,"permissions":{"inherit":true,"rolePermissions":[]},"targets":[],"statements":["dc6596d0-e89e-493a-be55-9abb40e52faf"],"effectSettings":{"type":"unconditionalDeny"},"condition":{"and":{"conditions":[{"comparison":{"left":{"attribute":{"id":"d3601f49-8768-408e-9104-8b4fb3afcfff"}},"op":"Equals","right":{"constant":{"value":"make_payment"}}}},{"comparison":{"left":{"attribute":{"id":"e93e97e7-da6e-46fb-aed6-4687fd9cc7d2"}},"op":"GreaterThan","right":{"constant":{"value":"500"}}}},{"not":{"condition":{"comparison":{"left":{"attribute":{"id":"e93e97e7-da6e-46fb-aed6-4687fd9cc7d2"}},"op":"GreaterThan","right":{"constant":{"value":"2000"}}}}}},{"not":{"condition":{"or":{"conditions":[{"and":{"conditions":[{"comparison":{"left":{"attribute":{"id":"8b1b9b7f-2f75-4cc5-812c-4232dbab85c5"}},"op":"Equals","right":{"constant":{"value":"true"}}}},{"comparison":{"left":{"attribute":{"id":"69698fbc-1c29-48ff-a16e-df9f07c7eaed"}},"op":"Equals","right":{"constant":{"value":"true"}}}}]}},{"and":{"conditions":[{"comparison":{"left":{"attribute":{"id":"fe331926-24ba-4822-86f3-f3daace2b8ca"}},"op":"Equals","right":{"constant":{"value":"urn:northwind:loa:staff-approval"}}}},{"comparison":{"left":{"attribute":{"id":"81b4ac87-1bdf-4942-a908-3434c6e8a26a"}},"op":"Contains","right":{"constant":{"value":"banking:payments:transfer"}}}}]}},{"comparison":{"left":{"attribute":{"id":"6e9214c7-7b5f-429f-b772-78fb74eaedc8"}},"op":"Equals","right":{"constant":{"value":"true"}}}}]}}}}]}},"properties":[]},{"id":"1bfca6f3-ff79-45da-8017-11009ca260d8","version":"93d8615f-9862-4f74-b352-748b244e0276","type":"Policy","name":"Agentic Banking Authorization","description":"Staff-approval channel: step-up satisfied by acr=urn:northwind:loa:staff-approval + banking:payments:transfer (Bob's out-of-band CIBA approval) OR the RAR match. Reconstructed from banking-staff-approval.deploymentpackage (source snapshot e37ad2da was never exported to git).","shared":false,"disabled":false,"combiningAlgorithm":{"algorithm":"DenyOverrides","evaluateAll":false},"children":[{"id":"e051c46c-fd77-407d-b9fc-25df9e515388","type":"Rule"},{"id":"4a0716a7-c2d4-4e58-af96-3db49c8848c0","type":"Rule"},{"id":"e69d2cd0-8255-42b9-8e10-4d8b1a506d8b","type":"Rule"},{"id":"170b2fad-30c9-4cd5-ada2-1d29d98e662b","type":"Rule"},{"id":"4057cc49-459b-4a1b-aeac-5846e5b3f1ec","type":"Rule"},{"id":"2ef9f47d-d4ba-4d6d-8964-d4a600f7fcc9","type":"Rule"},{"id":"751fbf1a-5f17-45c8-a700-a738b96eee92","type":"Rule"},{"id":"f615cc34-d544-4e9c-8f8d-4e6c1a1f93a2","type":"Rule"}],"repetitionSettings":null,"permissions":{"inherit":true,"rolePermissions":[]},"targets":[],"statements":[],"condition":{"empty":{}},"properties":[]},{"id":"e51688ff-1dc9-4b6c-bb36-8af64d02e9d1","version":"32842b67-7c43-4c5d-ad0b-457a6368aecf","type":"PolicySet","name":"Global Decision Point","description":"","shared":false,"disabled":false,"combiningAlgorithm":{"algorithm":"DenyOverrides","evaluateAll":false},"children":[{"id":"1bfca6f3-ff79-45da-8017-11009ca260d8","type":"Policy"}],"permissions":{"inherit":true,"rolePermissions":[]},"targets":[],"statements":[],"condition":{"empty":{}},"properties":[]},{"type":"SnapshotPackageFile$PackageSeparator"},{"type":"SnapshotPackageFile$EndOfPackage"},{"@class":"DataStreamFooter","digest":"VNzZ4dE0nyCWzGlnS256FKxMvklQ5zu3o1z5h1yyl8U="}]
